    "id": "rc:4146895271",
    "quote": "Fair point, I didn't consider that there could be potential use-cases where the context needs any further modification after its initial setup in `ECC_Start`"
   },
   "status_note": "furszy explained that having separate contexts avoids adding a mutex for verification thread safety if re-seeding is needed; theStack accepted the rationale",
